**Human-facing docs:** When writing or editing root `README.md`, `_ask/guide/`, or `_ask/docs/demo/`, read the prepared `humanizer` skill and follow it in embedded mode before finishing. Prepare it with `./ask prepare` if `.agents/skills/humanizer/SKILL.md` is missing. Keep every supported claim; do not invent facts. Leave code, commands, paths, YAML metadata, and link targets unchanged.

Do not apply this skill to specifications or other machine-first Markdown. Those use `writing-for-agents`. ADR: `_ask/docs/adr/0017-humanizer-docs-specs.md`.

Pin: `blader/humanizer` @ `v3.0.0` in `_ask/skills/manifest.yaml`. Do not copy the pattern list into kit files.

Canonical: `.agents/skills/humanizer/SKILL.md`.
